    "description": "<b>2018 Zurich ePrix / 2018 Julius Baer Zurich E-Prix</b>, Zurich Street Circuit, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zurich\">Zurich</a>, Switzerland — 10 June 2018<br><br>The inaugural 2018 Julius Baer Zurich E-Prix was held on 10 June 2018 at the Zurich Street Circuit, marking the first circuit race in Switzerland in 64 years.<br><br><b>Circuit:</b> 2.465 km Zurich Street Circuit (11 turns, 39 laps / 96.135 km)<br><b>Attendance:</b> approximately 150,000 spectators<br><b>Pole position:</b> Mitch Evans (Jaguar) – 1:12.811<br><b>Podium:</b> 1st Lucas di Grassi, 2nd Sam Bird, 3rd Jérôme d’Ambrosio<br><b>Fastest lap:</b> André Lotterer (1:14.730)<br><br><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2018_Zurich_ePrix\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2018_Zurich_ePrix</a><br><a href=\"https://www.fiaformulae.com/en/news/races/guide-welcome-to-the-2018-julius-baer-zurich-e-prix\">FIA Formula E race guide</a>",
